      <Output>
        <StdOut>Given a projectile MT case named "source" with input "10 45 9.81"
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.GivenAProjectileMtCase("source", "10 45 9.81") (0.1s)
And a projectile MT case named "follow-up" with input "20 45 9.81"
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.GivenAProjectileMtCase("follow-up", "20 45 9.81") (0.3s)
When I run both projectile cases
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.WhenIRunBothProjectileCases() (2.4s)
Then the projectile parsed value "range" of "follow-up" should exceed "source"
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.ThenProjectileParsedValueShouldExceed("range", "follow-up", "source") (0.0s)
And the follow-up range should be approximately 4 times the source range
-&gt; done: ProjectileRangeSteps.ThenFollowUpRangeRatio(4) (0.0s)</StdOut>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
